<title>FRANCE: Bouygues has 1.5 bln Ffr Asian contracts.</title>
<headline>Bouygues has 1.5 bln Ffr Asian contracts.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>French construction company Bouygues said on Monday it and its group companies have won three Asian contracts worth 1.5 billion francs.</p>
<p>The orders are for a 55-story building in Shanghai, at 450 million francs, a real estate project in Singapore for 660 million francs and a leisure complex in Bangkok for 400 million francs.</p>
</text>
